# Julia
# website: https://julialang.org
# docs: https://docs.julialang.org
# description: Julia code coverage profiles, memory allocation logs, package build artifacts, environments, and local preferences

# Code coverage profiles (julia --code-coverage)
*.jl.cov
*.jl.*.cov

# Memory allocation tracking (julia --track-allocation)
*.jl.mem
*.jl.*.mem

# Precompiled object cache
*.ji

# BinaryProvider and BinDeps build artifacts
deps/deps.jl
deps/build.log
deps/downloads/
deps/usr/
deps/src/

# Documenter.jl documentation build artifacts
docs/build/
docs/site/

# Pkg resolved environment manifest (ignore for packages, track for deployments)
Manifest*.toml

# Preferences.jl local preference overrides
LocalPreferences.toml
JuliaLocalPreferences.toml

# CondaPkg.jl local Conda environment
.CondaPkg/